Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value Required STATUS (Up|Down|Shutdown)
Value Required PROTOCOL (Up|Down)
Value Required VRF (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Interface\s+IP-Address\s+Status\s+Protocol\s+Vrf-Name\s*$$ -> Interfaces

Interfaces
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${VRF}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\S+[>#]\s*$$ -> End
  ^. -> Error "Unrecognized interface row"
